# Preplai Design & Illustration

When editing illustrations or design-related code:

## Double-`<g>` Pattern (Required)

Every component uses `buildEntityGroup(entity)` → `{ outerG, innerG }`:

- **outerG**: `translate(cx, cy)` for position. Never animated.
- **innerG**: All shapes and animation. Append children here only.

```ts
const { outerG, innerG } = buildEntityGroup(entity);
// ... append to innerG ...
applyEntranceAnimation(innerG, entity);
parentEl.appendChild(outerG);
return outerG;
```

## Design Tokens

Import from `design-tokens.ts`. No hardcoded stroke, font-size, or colors.

```ts
import { getCategoryColor, TYPOGRAPHY, STROKE } from '../design-tokens.js';
const color = entity.color ?? getCategoryColor('Cache');
text.setAttribute('font-size', String(TYPOGRAPHY.fontSizeLabel));
```

## GPU-Accelerated Animation Only

Animate: `opacity`, `transform` (translate, scale, rotate). Never animate `x`, `y`, `width`, `height`, `fill`, `stroke`, `cx`, `cy`, `r`.

## After Edits

```bash
pnpm --filter @preplai/illustrations run build
```

Test in Illustration Debug: `http://localhost:5173/dev/illustrations`
